                <pb facs="0782" n="700" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg700"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 816.032.</note>
                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <p rendition="#center">[Translation of extract concerning the United States.]</p>
                <p>I have given particular attention to increasing the cordiality o: our relations
                    with the United States of America, whose altruistic spirit toward the other
                    nations of this continent I take pleasure in recognizing and proclaiming. * *
                    *</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fernando Figueroa.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian" when="1911-02-08"
                            >February 8, 1911</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
